\label{ass:ill}
If the step size $h = \frac{1}{\sqrt{L}}$ for~(\ref{eqn:equiv_linear}), for the ill-conditioned eigenvalue $\omega_{i} \ll \sqrt{L}$, the coordinate variable can be approximated by the analytical solution as 
\begin{equation}
\label{eqn:approx}
\theta_{i} = h\omega_{i}, \qquad \text{and}\qquad\phi_{i} = \frac{\pi}{2}.
\end{equation}
\end{assumption}
